      <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Crypto Lending Risks on Solana: How Liquidations Work and How to Avoid Getting Wiped Out | DogeKing</h1>
      <time class="text-sm text-gray-500">2026</time>
      
      <div class="mt-3 flex gap-2 flex-wrap">
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-800 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">defi</span>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="prose prose-invert prose-gray max-w-none">
      <p>How liquidations work on Solana lending protocols like Kamino and Marginfi \u2014 LTV ratios, health factors, liquidation penalties, cascade liquidation...</p>
    </div>
